    <!-- specarch-problem: warning: test_golden_missing: operation payRefund has no golden scenario; add one under tests, for example pay-refund-succeeds: { operation: payRefund, scenario: golden, given: "a caller with refunds.pay", when: "payRefund is called", then: "it answers 200: Paid." } [test_golden_missing@specarch.yaml#/paths/~1refunds~1pay/post] -->
